  e.innerHTML=`<div class="cards-area blackjack-pro"><div class="game-status">${esc(s.message)} · 第 ${s.handNo} 局 ${practice?'<span class="practice-badge">AI 练习 · 真人筹码不变 / 计入 AI 对战榜</span>':'<span class="id-badge">真人/单人对庄 · 使用真实筹码</span>'}</div>${gameClockHtml(s)}${rules}<section class="bj-dealer"><b>庄家</b><div class="cards">${s.dealer.map(cardHtml).join('')}</div></section><div class="seat-grid">${s.seats.map((p,i)=>`<div class="seat ${p?.userId===state.profile.userId?'me':''} ${s.turnSeat===i?'turn':''}"><b>${i+1}号位 · ${esc(seatName(p))}</b>${p?`<div>${p.isBot?'练习筹码':'筹码'} ${p.chips} · ${p.boxes||1} 门 · 主注 ${(p.boxBets||[p.bet]).slice(0,p.boxes||1).join('/')} · 对子 ${(p.pairBets||[p.pairBet||0]).slice(0,p.boxes||1).join('/')} · ${p.isBot||String(p.userId).startsWith('BOT:')?'READY':p.ready?'READY':'未准备'}</div>${p.sideResult?`<small class="bj-side-result">${esc(p.sideResult)}</small>`:''}<div class="bj-hands">${(p.hands?.length?p.hands:[{cards:p.hand||[],bet:p.bet,box:1,result:p.result||''}]).map((x,j)=>bjHandHtml(x,j,s.turnSeat===i&&s.turnHand===j)).join('')}</div><div>${esc(p.result||'')}</div>${p.isBot?`<button data-remove-bot="${i}">移除 AI</button>`:''}`:`<div class="game-toolbar"><button data-seat="${i}">坐这里</button>${humanSeatCount(s)>0?`<button data-add-bot="${i}">+ AI</button>`:''}</div>`}</div>`).join('')}</div>${me>=0?`<div class="bj-betting"><div class="bj-box-count"><label>下注门数 <select id="bjBoxes">${[1,2,3].slice(0,s.maxBoxes||3).map(n=>`<option value="${n}" ${(mine.boxes||1)===n?'selected':''}>${n} 门</option>`).join('')}</select></label><button id="bjSetBoxes">设置门数</button></div>${Array.from({length:mine.boxes||1},(_,i)=>`<div class="bj-box-bet" data-bj-box="${i+1}"><b>第 ${i+1} 门</b><label>主注 <input data-bj-main type="number" min="${s.betMin||10}" max="${s.betMax||200}" value="${mine.boxBets?.[i]??mine.bet??s.defaultBet??20}"></label><label>对子边注 <input data-bj-pair type="number" min="0" max="${s.pairBetMax||100}" value="${mine.pairBets?.[i]??(i===0?mine.pairBet||0:0)}"></label><button data-bj-save>保存此门</button></div>`).join('')}</div>`:''}<div class="game-toolbar">${me>=0?`<button id="bjLeave">离座</button><button id="bjReady" class="${mine.ready?'':'primary'}">${mine.ready?'取消准备':'准备'}</button><button id="bjStart" ${canStart?'':'disabled'}>开始一局</button>${s.phase==='insurance'&&!mine.insuranceResolved?`<button id="bjInsurance" class="primary">买保险 ${Math.floor((mine.hands||[]).reduce((n,x)=>n+(Number(x.bet)||0),0)/2)}</button><button id="bjInsuranceNo">不买保险</button>`:''}${canAct?`<button id="bjHit" class="primary">要牌</button><button id="bjStand">停牌</button><button id="bjDouble" ${canDouble?'':'disabled'}>加倍</button><button id="bjSplit" ${canSplit?'':'disabled'}>分牌</button><button id="bjSurrender" ${canSurrender?'':'disabled'}>投降（输半注）</button>`:''}`:''}</div><div class="ready-help">可以只和庄家 1v1，此时正常计算个人筹码；只要加入 AI 就进入练习模式，真人筹码不结算。支持 1～3 个下注门，每一门独立下注并可下对子边注；对子边注只看两张起手牌是否同牌面（例如 7+7、K+K），不看花色；标准分牌按同点数牌处理，可继续重分，最多形成 4 手牌。</div></div>`;
